# portable-tpcc repository rules

Full text: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

## Style and analysis

- Preserve the coding style of the directory being modified; do not perform drive-by refactoring.
- Before making changes, study the context, dependencies, and `ya.make`; minimize the diff.
- Ask the user if the task is ambiguous or requires changes in protected areas.

## Do not modify without an explicit user request

Directories: `build/`, `contrib/`, `devtools/`, `library/`, `util/`.
